cause: UNKNOWN_CAUSE
effect: UNKNOWN_EFFECT
header_text {
  translation {
    text: "LD3 notice: beginning Sun Jan 4."
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: "Change\r\nOperations return to Coffman Street, between 9th Ave and 3rd Ave, to serve the 8th & Coffman Park-n-Ride (instead of Bross/8th Street). Minor changes to schedule.\r\n\nReason\r\nImprove on-time performance and service reliability, accounting for opening of the Coffman Corridor.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 22 respondents, 41% reported a positive impact from the change, 45% indicated it had no impact, and 14% perceived the change negatively.\r\n\nEffective January 4, 2026\r\nWith expected completion of the Coffman Street Mobility Improvements Project by the end of 2025, RTD will resume service to the bus stops at the RTD Park-n-Ride at 8th Avenue. and Coffman Street. The stops were moved in June 2024 to a temporary location directly across Roosevelt Park on Bross St. between 8th Avenue. and Longs Peak Avenue. The RTD Park-n-Ride has remained open during construction.\r\n\nCustomers can also access the Longmont FlexRide service at the southwest corner of the Park-n-Ride.\r\nThe Coffman Street Mobility Improvements project extends from 1st Avenue. to 9th Avenue. and will become a world-class multi-modal corridor that will include robust public transit (local, regional and BRT buses)."
    language: "en"
  }
}
